title: EvelynVentressLibrary
---
Evelyn Ventress: Evelyn pokes her head into the dimly lit room and sees two bookcases and a desk. She walks over to the desk and rifles through papers, searching for answers.
->The pages are empty.
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	She puts the pages down on the desk and searches the room. 
->"Answers? You want answers? There has never been and never will be answers for any of this.”
    <<add_fear "Evelyn Ventress">>
    <<discover_fear "Evelyn Ventress" 5>>
    <<terrified "Evelyn Ventress">>
    //Fear of Meaninglessness
	The words on the page seem meaningless to her now. She rests her head on the desk and softly cries. 
->The pages depict ancient rituals.
    <<reduce_fear Evelyn Ventress">>"
    <<determined "Evelyn Ventress">>
	“Interesting…” With intense fascination, she reads through pages on blood sacrifices and portal openings. 
->The pages show various passages from the Bible.
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	2 Peter 2:1-2…James 3:1…Matthew 7:21-23… She briefly looks over the contents but has no patience for traditional religion.  
===
title: EvelynVentressDungeon
---
Evelyn Ventress: When Evelyn walks into the room, she immediately detects the distinct smell of dried blood, which explains the dark splotches on the floor. She sees a cell door and walks inside.
->Reveal a disheveled man lying in the cell with her.
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	From the corner of her eye, she sees the man and slowly approaches. “Sir, are you okay?” As she speaks these words, his body fades into air. 
->Have the stone roof begin to collapse. 
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	Quickly, she retreats out of the cell. Wiping a bead of sweat from her forehead, she smiles, imagining herself as Indiana Jones at this moment. 
->Slam the door behind her.
    <<add_fear "Evelyn Ventress">>
    <<discover_fear "Evelyn Ventress" 1>>
    <<terrified "Evelyn Ventress">>
    //Fear of Isolation
	“No no no no no no!” She lunges toward the bars, pulling hard but getting nowhere. Sweating, she collapses to the ground and stays there until the door cracks open once more.
->Reveal a little girl in the cell with her. 
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	Evelyn looks over her shoulder and notices the child. Carefully, she approaches. “Hi, honey. How did you get here?” She reaches for the child’s arm as the apparition fades into air. 
===
title: EvelynVentressDiningRoom
---
Evelyn Ventress: Walking into the room, Evelyn is delighted by the decor. She walks to the head of an ornately prepared  table. It looks as if it hasn’t been touched in years. 
->”Inspect the dusty plates on the table.”
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	She picks up one of the plates and places it back down. Nothing interesting to see there. 
->”Inspect the potted plants around the table.”
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	“Wow, these are lovely.” She is delighted by the plants.
->”This room is boring. You want to leave.”
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	Evelyn feels confused when she wants to leave because she likes this dated style. 
->”Inspect the cobwebs in the corner of the roof.”
    <<add_fear "Evelyn Ventress">>
    <<discover_fear "Evelyn Ventress" 9>>
    <<terrified "Evelyn Ventress">>
    //Fear of spiders
	She walks to the corner of the room and cranes her neck upward. The cobwebs looks harmless, but, as she walks away, she feels a tickle on her shoulder. Glancing left, she sees a massive spider crawling toward her face, and she screams before batting it off.   
===
title: EvelynVentressCemetery
---
Evelyn Ventress: Evelyn is taken aback at first sight of the cemetery. She finds it strange that such a place would be located at the center of this labyrinth. She stands there, taking it in. 
->Create an exaggerated spooky ghost sound.
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	She chuckles a bit. “What the hell could that be?”
->Create nothing but the sounds of wind blowing through the grass.
    <<add_fear "Evelyn Ventress">>
    <<discover_fear "Evelyn Ventress" 0>>
    <<terrified "Evelyn Ventress">>
    //Fear of silence
	The sound unnerves her, causing goosebumps to rise on the nape of her neck. She hugs her arms and shivers. 
->Create the sound of stones cracking.
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	She startles at the unexpected noise. She searches the cemetery for the source of that sound but finds nothing.
->Create the sound of a siren blaring.
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	“Someone’s coming to save me!” She runs in the direction of the siren, but when it abruptly stops, she assumes it was a cruel trick to give her false hope. 
===

title: EvelynVentressRitualRoom
---
Evelyn Ventress: Evelyn walks into the room and inspects a lectern standing nearby. She then drifts toward a strange pool in the center of the room. “What is that?”
->"It’s blood.”
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	“Obviously, but where did it come from?”
-"Something harvested it from you while you were unconscious. You've lost so much blood.”
    <<add_fear "Evelyn Ventress">>
    <<discover_fear "Evelyn Ventress" 8>>
    <<terrified "Evelyn Ventress">>
    //Fear of weakness
	As she considers this, she begins to feel weak and dizzy. She tries to find something to steady herself, but there’s nothing. She sweats, panicked by the thought that she may be slowly dying. 
->"Look! It’s Kool-Aid!”
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	“I don’t think that’s right.”
->"It’s diseased blood. There are so many germs lurking in it.”
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	She examines it closely for indications of disease, but it’s not obvious to the naked eye. The thought of it fascinates her. 
===

title: EvelynVentressBedroom
---
Evelyn Ventress: As Evelyn creeps into the bedroom, the atmosphere of the space disturbs her. It reminds her of her time working in a hospital. She analyzes the scene before her. 
->Create an envelope on the bedside table.
    <<add_fear "Evelyn Ventress">>
    <<discover_fear "Evelyn Ventress" 6>>
    <<terrified "Evelyn Ventress">>
    //Fear of Gene
	Evelyn shudders. It’s an envelope with a red wax seal. “This must be Gene’s room. I knew he was behind  this.” She keeps glancing over her shoulder, waiting for him to reappear. 
->Create a hypodermic needle on the bedside table. 
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	Evelyn walks to the bedside table and inspects the needle. “This may be someone's hospital room.”
->Let her explore.
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	Evelyn walks around the room, analyzing its contents. 
->Make the wheelchair roll on its own. 
    <<neutral "Evelyn Ventress">>
	“Strange… Must be the wind.”
